  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx = 14 ; y = 15 ; z = 17\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nx3 + y3 + z3 - 3xyz = 1/2 × (x + y + z) × [(x -y)² + (y -z)2 + (z - x)2]\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nx3 + y3 + z3 - 3xyz = 1/2 × (x + y + z) × [(x -y)2 + (y -z)2 + (z - x)2]\n\n⇒ 1/2 × (14 + 15 + 17) × [(14 - 15)2 + (15 - 17)2 + (17 - 14)2]\n\n⇒ 23 × [(- 1)2 + (- 2)2 + (3)2]\n\n⇒ 23 × [1 + 4 + 9]\n\n⇒ 23 × 14 = 322\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 322.**",
